{"2192970": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "All On Board!", "steam_appid": 2192970, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [3058460, 3078860, 3061340, 3058470, 3078880, 3400410, 3628130, 3653210], "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Built for people who love board games, <i>All On Board!</i> brings game nights back to life.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The laughter, the rivalry, the quiet focus before a decisive roll, it’s all here in VR/XR. Gather around a virtual table that feels real, no matter how far apart you are.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2192970/extras/60bad8480ed8bf049ce91ace5e01a0c7.poster.avif?t=1787226304\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2192970/extras/60bad8480ed8bf049ce91ace5e01a0c7.webm?t=1787226304\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2192970/extras/60bad8480ed8bf049ce91ace5e01a0c7.mp4?t=1787226304\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>All On Board!</i>  lets you enjoy digital versions of the tabletop games you love. The library includes free classics and reknowned licensed titles sold separately as DLC (DLC purchase is required only to host, <strong>you can join any game with just the base app</strong>).</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>Virus!</i> now available for FREE!</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Virus!</i> has arrived, and it joins the platform as a <strong>free game for every <i>All On Board!</i> player. </strong>Experimental virus outbreaks have escaped the lab and only you can stop them. Collect your organs, keep them safe from infection, and use your cards to mess with your opponents along the way. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2192970/extras/8d4eaa34473d701667b768df5c02cc09.avif?t=1787226304\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2192970/extras_big/8d4eaa34473d701667b768df5c02cc09.webp?t=1787226304 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2192970/extras/0a636b071d4a3c6e117305bc3b193351.avif?t=1787226304\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2192970/extras_big/0a636b071d4a3c6e117305bc3b193351.webp?t=1787226304 width=1560 height=1558 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each game is adapted with care and respect for what makes it special. Every shuffle, move, and chaotic moment shared among friends is brought to life in virtual space. This isn’t about replacing the table. It’s about expanding it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2192970/extras/c01a65c48073536706279546dfb52dc6.poster.avif?t=1787226304\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2192970/extras/c01a65c48073536706279546dfb52dc6.webm?t=1787226304\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2192970/extras/c01a65c48073536706279546dfb52dc6.mp4?t=1787226304\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lifelike VR tabletop experience</strong> with realistic physics and intuitive controls</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Only the host buys the licensed title</strong>; others join with the base app</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Growing library</strong> of licensed favorites and free classics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cross-platform</strong> and multi-language support</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Solo, co-op</strong>, or competitive sessions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Learning Hub in every game</strong> to help you learn fast</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Save and resume</strong> anytime</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2192970/extras/de68a7779e644bb946cb2d45386eddd0.poster.avif?t=1787226304\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2192970/extras/de68a7779e644bb946cb2d45386eddd0.webm?t=1787226304\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2192970/extras/de68a7779e644bb946cb2d45386eddd0.mp4?t=1787226304\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find other players in our Discord or Telegram and start a session (no AI opponents).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>All On Board!</i> is made by an independent studio that loves board games as much as you do. It’s built on passion, constant updates, and a growing lineup of great titles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2192970/extras/828c764946c53525d3bb99cd8bfc076f.poster.avif?t=1787226304\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2192970/extras/828c764946c53525d3bb99cd8bfc076f.webm?t=1787226304\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2192970/extras/828c764946c53525d3bb99cd8bfc076f.mp4?t=1787226304\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Built for people who love board games, <i>All On Board!</i> brings game nights back to life.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The laughter, the rivalry, the quiet focus before a decisive roll, it’s all here in VR/XR. Gather around a virtual table that feels real, no matter how far apart you are.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2192970/extras/60bad8480ed8bf049ce91ace5e01a0c7.poster.avif?t=1787226304\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2192970/extras/60bad8480ed8bf049ce91ace5e01a0c7.webm?t=1787226304\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2192970/extras/60bad8480ed8bf049ce91ace5e01a0c7.mp4?t=1787226304\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>All On Board!</i>  lets you enjoy digital versions of the tabletop games you love. The library includes free classics and reknowned licensed titles sold separately as DLC (DLC purchase is required only to host, <strong>you can join any game with just the base app</strong>).</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>Virus!</i> now available for FREE!</