ou do. It’s built on passion, constant updates, and a growing lineup of great titles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2192970/extras/828c764946c53525d3bb99cd8bfc076f.poster.avif?t=1787226304\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2192970/extras/828c764946c53525d3bb99cd8bfc076f.webm?t=1787226304\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2192970/extras/828c764946c53525d3bb99cd8bfc076f.mp4?t=1787226304\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Built for board game lovers, All On Board! brings back the magic of game nights to VR. Enjoy adapted versions of your favorite titles with friends, lifelike physics, and thoughtful design that make every match feel real, like gathering around a table wherever you are.", "supported_languages": "English, Spanish - Spain, French, Italian, German", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2192970/f2aa35a4e13590fc33c801229deb99200ed8c1df/header.jpg?t=1787226304", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2192970/cf221ce690e800ffa9aae49bb1c8a992567ce352/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787226304", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2192970/cf221ce690e800ffa9aae49bb1c8a992567ce352/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1787226304", "website": "https://thegamekitchen.com/all-on-board-vr/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10, Windows 11<br></li><li><strong>Proces